B.ahk=new A.b8(B.b4Y,B.b0u,"Yes. Prayer is never dropped because of illness; it is made easier. If you cannot stand, pray sitting; if you cannot sit, pray lying on your side. The Prophet \ufdfa told 'Imran ibn Husayn, who had piles: pray standing, and if you cannot, then sitting, and if you cannot, then on your side (Sahih al-Bukhari 1117).\n\nHow: if you can stand for part of the prayer, stand for that part. If you can stand but not go down to the ground, stand for the standing and bow and prostrate by nodding. If you cannot go down, nod your head for ruku' and again, lower, for sujud. Sitting on a chair is acceptable when sitting on the floor is not possible. The Qur'an says \"Allah does not charge a soul except [with that within] its capacity\" (Qur'an 2:286).\n\nIf you are too ill to pray at the right time, you may combine Dhuhr with Asr and Maghrib with Isha according to the Hanbali school (and some Shafi'i and Maliki scholars); otherwise pray each as best you can. Keep praying as long as you have your mind; if you lose consciousness, ask a scholar about making it up.\n\nThe Illness and Patience guide has more help.\n\nSource: Sahih al-Bukhari 1117; Qur'an 2:286.\n[GO:/huda/guide?id=huda-illness]",!0,"")
B.aEi=s(["\\b(?:make up|makeup|make-up|catch up|compensate|repay|replace)\\b.*\\b(?:missed|skipped|forgotten|lost|old|past|backlog)\\b.*\\bprayers?\\b","\\bmissed prayers?\\b","\\bqada\\b.*\\bprayers?\\b","\\bprayers? qada\\b","\\bqada prayers?\\b","\\bmiss(?:ed|ing)?\\b.*\\b(?:prayers?|fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)\\b","\\b(?:skip(?:ped)?|overslept|slept through|sleep through|woke up late for)\\b.*\\b(?:prayers?|fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)\\b","\\bforgot (?:to pray|my (?:prayers?|fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha)|about (?:the )?(?:prayers?|fajr|dhuhr|asr|maghrib|isha))\\b","\\bhavent prayed\\b","\\bdidnt pray\\b.*\\b(?:years|long|months)\\b","\\bnot prayed for\\b","\\bstopped praying\\b","\\bprayers? (?:i|i have) (?:missed|skipped|not prayed)\\b","\\bmake up\\b.*\\bprayers?\\b","\\bprayers? make up\\b"],t.s)
B.aXW=s(["\\b(?:fast\\w*|ramadan|period|menstrua\\w*|cycle)\\b","\\bfor (?:many |several |a few |\\d+ )?(?:years|months|decades)\\b"],t.s)
B.ai2=new A.b8(B.aEi,B.aXW,"If you missed a prayer because you slept through it or forgot, pray it as soon as you remember. The Prophet \ufdfa said: if anyone forgets a prayer, he should pray it when he remembers it, and it has no expiation except that (Sahih al-Bukhari 597) (Sahih Muslim 684).\n\nIf you left a prayer on purpose or over a long time (years): that is a serious matter, so start with sincere tawbah (repentance) and begin praying on time from today. Most scholars (all four schools) say the missed prayers are still owed and should be made up. A minority say they cannot be made up and the way out is repentance and voluntary prayers. Follow the view of your school and ask a trusted scholar if you are unsure.\n\nHow to make them up: pray each missed prayer in its own rak'ah count (Fajr as 2, Dhuhr as 4 and so on), in order if you can. If you do not know how many you missed, estimate honestly and pray until you are sure you have covered them. A practical way is to pray one or two make-up prayers after each of today's prayers until the debt is done, without leaving your current prayers on time. A woman does not make up prayers missed during her period.\n\nThe Making Up Missed Prayers guide in this app lays out the method.\n\nSource: Sahih al-Bukhari 597; Sahih Muslim 684.\n[GO:/huda/guide?id=huda-qada]",!0,"The Prophet \ufdfa said a forgotten prayer has no expiation except to pray it, so it is prayed when remembered; for a prayer left on purpose, most scholars hold the debt is still there, so it is made up along with sincere repentance.")
B.aOr=s(["\\bsocks?\\b","\\bkhuff\\w*\\b","\\bmasah\\b","\\bwip(?:e|ing) over\\b","\\bshoes?\\b.*\\bprayers?\\b","\\bprayers?\\b.*\\b(?:shoes?|sandals?|slippers?|footwear)\\b","\\bpray(?:ing)? (?:in|with|wearing) (?:shoes?|sandals?|socks?)\\b"],t.s)
