B.ahQ=new A.b8(B.b5z,B.aZn,'I am Hadi, the guide inside this app. I am not a scholar, a sheikh or a mufti, and I cannot issue a fatwa. I answer from a built-in library of the Qur\'an and the Sunnah, show where each answer comes from (the source card gives the collection, the number, and for hadith the grade and who graded it), and take you to the right screen of the app.\n\nI can help with:\n- Worship: wudu, ghusl, prayer, fasting, zakat, Hajj and Umrah, funerals.\n- What is halal and haram in food, money and everyday life, and family and marriage questions.\n- The basics of belief, the Prophet\'s life, the companions and Islamic history.\n- Du\'as, and where to find things in the app: Qur\'an, Prayer Times, Qibla, Games, the Academy and more.\n\nWho has reviewed this: no one yet. The app\'s own words are "Scholar review needed. No named scholar has reviewed this app yet. We check every citation we can, we say so when we cannot, and we will name a reviewer here only once one has agreed to be named."\n\nWhere the schools of law differ, I say so and do not pick one for you. For a ruling on your own case (a divorce, an inheritance, a debt), I will not guess: a qualified scholar who can ask you questions must answer. I can be wrong, so please treat my answers as a study aid and check the source. If I do not know something, I say so.\n\nI answer in English only. Ask me anything about Islam or the app, for example "how many rak\'ahs is Fajr", "is gelatin halal" or "how do I play Ludo".\n[GO:/sources]',!0,"")
B.aR5=s(["\\bstreaks?\\b","\\bpoints?\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi|game|games|quran|prayer|worship|earn|get|score|reward)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi|game|games|worship)\\b.*\\bpoints?\\b","\\bcoins?\\b","\\bbadges?\\b","\\bleaderboards?\\b","\\blevels? up\\b","\\bgamif\\w*\\b","\\bdays returned\\b","\\bcome back (?:streak|calendar)\\b","\\breward(?:s)? (?:in|for) the app\\b","\\bdoes the app (?:track|count|score)\\b","\\bwhat is keep my streaks\\b","\\bturn (?:off|on) streaks?\\b"],t.s)
B.b2M=s(["\\b(?:good deeds?|hasanat|hasanah|reward from allah|reward in|rewards? of)\\b"],t.s)
B.ahE=new A.b8(B.aR5,B.b2M,'Streaks are optional and are off until you turn them on. The switch is called "Keep my streaks": you find it in Settings under "Coming back", and on the Streaks screen.\n\nWhen it is on, the app keeps a private calendar, on your device only, of the days you read the Qur\'an, do dhikr and tasbeeh, log a prayer, or come back to the app. The calendar is gentle on purpose: one day off each week is forgiven. There are no points, coins, ranks or leaderboards for worship anywhere in the app; the calendar only helps you see your own pattern, and your reward is with Allah. The prayer calendar is read from your own prayer log, stays private and can never be shared. If you switch streaks off, the saved days are erased; your prayer log stays as it is.\n[GO:/streaks]\n[GO:/settings]',!0,"")
B.aJZ=s(["\\b(?:change|switch|set|choose|pick|select|use) (?:the |my )?(?:app )?language\\b","\\blanguage (?:of|in|for|settings?|options?|menu)\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b.*\\blanguages?\\b","\\bis (?:the )?(?:app|hadi) (?:available|translated|offered) in\\b","\\b(?:does|can) (?:the )?(?:app|hadi) (?:speak|understand|support|answer in|reply in|work in|talk in)\\b","\\b(?:app|hadi) in (?:urdu|arabic|bangla|bengali|french|turkish|malay|indonesian|hindi|spanish|german|english)\\b","\\b(?:urdu|arabic|bangla|bengali|french|turkish|malay|indonesian|hindi|spanish|german) (?:version|language|translation|support)\\b.*\\b(?:app|hadi)\\b","\\btranslate the app\\b","\\blanguage and voice\\b","\\blanguage \\& voice\\b","\\bwhich languages\\b","\\bwhat languages\\b","\\bavailable languages\\b","\\bvoice (?:reading|read aloud|reader)\\b","\\bread (?:it |answers? |text )?aloud\\b","\\btext to speech\\b","\\bmy language\\b"],t.s)
