B.ahW=new A.b8(B.aJZ,B.aSm,'You change the language on the Language & Voice screen: open the menu and choose "Language & Voice" (or Settings, then the language row). The app offers English, Urdu, Arabic, Indonesian, French, Turkish, Bangla and Malay, but not all of them are translated yet, and the screen says so for each one:\n- Arabic, Bangla and Urdu: the menu and tab names, the titles on the Home screen, the first questions you see when you open the app, and the top of Settings are translated. These are first drafts waiting for a native speaker to check them. Arabic and Urdu also turn the layout right-to-left.\n- Indonesian: only the Language & Voice labels are translated.\n- French, Turkish and Malay: not translated yet; the app stays in English.\n\nLessons, stories, hadith, my answers, the prayer screens and every long text are still in English, with the original Arabic for scripture. I answer in English only. Natural human-sounding voices are not available yet: until they are, the device reads the words in its own voice.\n[GO:/settings/language]',!0,"")
B.aQM=s(["\\bdownloads?\\b","\\bdownload(?:ing)? (?:the )?(?:quran|recitation|audio|surah|reciter|ayah|app|nasheed|content|duas?|lessons?)\\b","\\boffline\\b","\\bwithout (?:the )?(?:internet|wifi|wi fi|data|network)\\b","\\bno (?:internet|wifi|wi fi|network|connection|signal)\\b","\\b(?:work|works|working|use|using) (?:the )?(?:app )?(?:offline|without internet)\\b","\\bsave (?:the )?(?:recitation|audio|surah|quran)\\b","\\bstorage\\b","\\bdata usage\\b","\\bmobile data\\b","\\bhow much space\\b","\\bdelete (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b","\\bremove (?:a |my |the )?downloads?\\b"],t.s)
B.aTm=s(["\\b(?:hadith|youtube|spotify)\\b","\\b(?:hadi|you|ai)\\b.*\\boffline\\b","\\boffline (?:mode|ai|hadi)\\b"],t.s)
B.aiD=new A.b8(B.aQM,B.aTm,"Most of the app works without the internet. The Qur'an text, the stories, the guides and the duas are already inside the app. What you can download is recitation audio, so you can listen with no connection.\n\nTo do it, open Downloads (from the menu). Pick a reciter and download a surah or more; each row shows its size, whether it is waiting, downloading, paused or on your device. A few points:\n- Downloads are for the reciter you have chosen only; change the reciter on that screen if you want another.\n- \"Wi-Fi only\" is a switch so that big downloads wait for Wi-Fi and do not use mobile data. Your phone only guesses which network it is on, so check before a big download.\n- You can pause at any time and delete any download later to free the space.\n- In a web browser, downloads are kept in the browser's storage, and the app still needs the internet to open. The Android app keeps everything on the phone and opens with no internet.\n[GO:/downloads]",!0,"")
B.b1w=s(["\\b(?:kids?|children|child) (?:section|mode|corner|area|zone|page|part|feature|profile|profiles|friendly|safe)\\b","\\bfor children\\b","\\bis (?:the )?app (?:safe|suitable|ok|okay|good) for (?:kids?|children|my (?:kid|child|son|daughter))\\b","\\b(?:kids?|children) (?:in|on) (?:the )?app\\b","\\bmy (?:kid|kids|child|children|son|daughter)s? (?:use|using|play|playing|learn|learning)\\b.*\\bapp\\b","\\bparental (?:controls?|gate|check)\\b","\\bfamily wing\\b","\\bchild profiles?\\b","\\bwhere (?:are|is) (?:the )?(?:kids?|children)\\b","\\bapp for (?:kids?|children)\\b","\\bteach (?:my )?(?:kids?|children) (?:with|using|in) (?:the )?app\\b","\\bletters? for (?:kids?|children)\\b"],t.s)
B.aKS=s(["\\b(?:how to raise|parenting|discipline|hit|beat|spank|pray at what age|what age)\\b"],t.s)
B.aiM=new A.b8(B.b1w,B.aKS,'The For Children section has three doors: the Arabic letters (learn them one at a time), Games (play and learn), and the Stories school (stories with a lesson to talk about). On the Home screen it is the "For Children" tile. A grown-up can sit with the child.\n\nAbout privacy: the app is a general-audience app and is not directed to children under 13. In the Family Wing a parent can add child profiles that keep only a first name or nickname and the child\'s progress in the Arabic letters, and they stay on the device. No age, photo, voice, e-mail, phone number or location is asked for. Adding or removing a child sits behind a parent check. The online game tables (Ludo and Shatranj with a friend, using a six-letter code) are off for every child unless a parent switches them on. The full text is in the Privacy policy screen.\n[GO:/academy/family]',!0,"")
B.aPf=s(["\\b(?:change|switch|set|choose|pick|select|update|find|where is|how do i set)\\b.*\\b(?:my )?(?:school of (?:law|thought)|madhhab|madhab|mazhab)\\b","\\b(?:my )?(?:school of (?:law|thought)|madhhab)\\b.*\\b(?:setting|settings|menu|app|hadi|change|set|choose|select)\\b","\\bwhich school (?:does|do) (?:hadi|you|the app) follow\\b","\\bwhat madhhab (?:are you|is hadi|does hadi)\\b","\\bare you (?:hanafi|shafii|maliki|hanbali|sunni|shia)\\b","\\bset (?:to )?(?:hanafi|shafii|maliki|hanbali)\\b","\\bhanafi (?:mode|setting)\\b","\\bwhy does hadi (?:ask|say) .*school\\b"],t.s)
B.aiF=new A.b8(B.aPf,B.c,'Open the Hadi screen, tap the menu in the corner and choose "Your school of law". You can pick Not sure, Hanafi, Shafi\'i, Maliki or Hanbali. It is kept on your device only.\n\nWhat it changes: where the four schools differ, I name your school\'s view first and say plainly that other schools differ. I never say another school is wrong. If you pick "Not sure", I say that the schools differ and do not pick one for you. Where I do not hold a verified text for a single school, I say that and point you to a scholar of your school.\n\nI answer from the Sunni tradition: the Qur\'an and the Sunnah, with the four Sunni schools of law. I am a study aid, not a mufti.',!0,"")
B.aUM=s(["\\bis (?:my )?(?:data|privacy|information|chat|chats|conversation|conversations|messages?) (?:private|safe|secure|stored|shared|sold|saved|recorded|tracked|kept)\\b","\\b(?:privacy|privacy policy|terms of service|terms and conditions)\\b","\\bdo you (?:track|store|save|record|sell|share|collect|log) (?:my |our )?(?:data|chats?|conversations?|messages?|questions?|location)\\b","\\bwho (?:sees|reads|can see|can read) (?:my )?(?:chats?|questions?|messages?|data|conversations?)\\b","\\bdoes (?:the )?app (?:have|show|contain|run) (?:ads|adverts|advertising|advertisements)\\b","\\bany ads\\b","\\badvert\\w*\\b","\\bis (?:the )?app (?:free|paid|premium|subscription)\\b","\\bis (?:this|it) (?:free|paid)\\b","\\bhow much (?:does|do|is) (?:the )?(?:app|it) cost\\b","\\b(?:subscription|premium|pro version|in app purchase|paywall|pricing|price of the app)\\b","\\bwho (?:owns|runs|made|built|funds) (?:the |this )?app\\b","\\bwho is behind (?:the )?app\\b","\\bdelete (?:my )?(?:account|data|history|chats?|conversation|conversations)\\b","\\bclear (?:my )?(?:chat|history|conversations?|data)\\b","\\bdo i need (?:an? )?(?:account|login|sign ?up|api key)\\b","\\bsign in\\b","\\bapi key\\b","\\bis (?:it|hadi) online\\b","\\bdoes hadi (?:need|use|work) (?:the )?(?:internet|online|api|ai)\\b","\\bis (?:hadi|this) (?:an? )?(?:offline|online)\\b"],t.s)
B.b_B=s(["\\boffline\\b","\\b(?:who (?:runs|owns|funds|pays for|is behind|made|built|created)|owner of|funded|funds it|funding|company behind)\\b","\\b(?:data of|big data|quran data)\\b"],t.s)
B.ahD=new A.b8(B.aUM,B.b_B,'What I can tell you, from the app\'s own Privacy policy screen:\n- Your settings, bookmarks, progress, reflections and saved conversations with me are stored on your device. You can clear them by clearing the app\'s data.\n- I answer from a library built into the app, which does not leave your device. Only if you choose to add your own key for an AI provider are your key and the messages of that conversation sent to that provider, under its terms. Messages that look like a personal crisis are answered on the device and are not sent or saved.\n- Accounts: if you create one, sign-in uses Firebase Authentication. You can delete your account and data from Settings: the "Delete my account" link opens the Delete account screen. What you post in the Majlis is public.\n- Prayer times, Qibla and the mosque finder use the location you give or allow; the app contacts services such as prayer-time and map services and audio servers to work.\n- The policy says: "We do not sell personal data or show advertising based on it."\n\nWhat I cannot tell you: I do not have a price list or a statement about future plans, so I will not guess whether anything will be paid or free later. The Terms and Privacy screens are the place to read the exact words; the policy there is marked as a draft.',!0,"")
B.aLV=s(["\\bwho is wasia\\b","\\bwhat is wasia\\b","\\bwhos wasia\\b","^wasia$","^(?:tell me about )?wasia\\b","\\bis wasia (?:real|a person|an ai|a robot|ai)\\b"],t.s)
B.ai4=new A.b8(B.aLV,B.c,"Wasia is the AI teacher of the Wasia Academy, the letter school built with love. She teaches the Arabic alphabet, reads with the child, and speaks in three voices: student, parent, and a Teachers' Corner for parents. Shall I take you there?\n[GO:/academy/gate]",!0,"")
B.aS7=s(["\\bwhat is (?:the )?(?:wasia )?academy\\b","\\bwasia\\b","\\b(?:wasia )?academy\\b.*\\b(?:what|how|where|start|begin|open|lessons?|courses?|schools?)\\b","\\bhow (?:do|to|can) i (?:start|begin|use) (?:the )?academy\\b","\\bwhere (?:is|are) (?:the )?(?:academy|lessons|courses)\\b","\\bi want to learn (?:islam|arabic|quran|prayer)\\b.*\\bapp\\b","\\bwhat (?:lessons|courses|schools) (?:are|do you have|does the app have)\\b","\\bletter school\\b","\\bschool of letters\\b","\\bteacher in the app\\b"],t.s)
B.b0L=s(["\\b(?:hifz|memori[sz]e)\\b"],t.s)
B.ahu=new A.b8(B.aS7,B.b0L,'The Wasia Academy is the learning part of the app. It is on the Home screen as "Wasia Academy: learn with your teacher". It opens the school of Arabic letters, with Wasia as your teacher, and the other schools for learning step by step, such as Qur\'anic Arabic, Aqeedah, Seerah, Hadith, Family life, Ramadan Mode, Hifz and Hajj and Umrah.\n\nStart with the Arabic letters if you are a beginner. A parent can set up child profiles in the Family Wing. For a quick answer rather than a course, ask me.\n[GO:/academy]',!0,"")
B.b3m=s(["\\bhow (?:does|do) (?:scoring|score|scores|points|winning) work\\b","\\bscoring\\b","\\bhow (?:do|to) (?:i )?win\\b","\\bhow does (?:the )?game (?:end|work)\\b","\\bhints?\\b.*\\bgame\\b","\\bis there a timer\\b","\\bgame (?:settings?|options?)\\b","\\bresume\\b","\\bcontinue (?:a |my |the )?(?:game|playing)\\b","\\bfinish (?:a |my |the )?game\\b","\\bunfinished game\\b","\\bgame history\\b","\\bmy (?:game )?history\\b","\\bpast games\\b","\\bprevious games\\b","\\bwhere (?:is|are) my (?:game|games|results?|history|score|scores)\\b","\\bsaved games?\\b","\\bpractice (?:with|a) friend\\b","\\bplay (?:with|against) (?:a )?friend\\b","\\bplay online\\b"],t.s)
