B.aOJ=s(["I am still here, and I am glad you are telling me more. You do not have to make sense of all of it tonight. Please keep the lines above close, and stay near someone if you can.","I hear you. Pain this heavy is not weakness, and it does not mean Allah has left you: He told His Prophet \ufdfa, \u201cYour Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you].\u201d (Qur\u2019an 93:3). If the thoughts get stronger, call the number for your country above or your local emergency number right then.","I am staying right here. One small step: message or call one person you trust and tell them just one sentence, \u201cI am not okay.\u201d You do not need to explain more than that tonight."],t.s)
