B.LX=s(["Hadi: The dice decide the roll; you decide the move.","Hadi: A pawn sent home is not an ending; the board always invites return.","Hadi: Patience. The six will come.","Hadi: I protect my stars. Do you protect yours?","Hadi: One careful step beats three hurried ones."],t.s)
