B.apY=new A.hM("taqwa","Being mindful of Allah: doing what pleases Him and staying away from what displeases Him, in public and in private.",B.c)
B.aq3=new A.hM("nisab","The minimum amount of wealth a person must hold before zakat is due on it.",B.c)
B.aqk=new A.hM("hawl","The lunar year that wealth is held for. Zakat on savings is due once the nisab has been held for a full hawl.",B.c)
B.b5I=s(["zakah"],t.s)
B.aqh=new A.hM("zakat","The yearly giving of a set share of one\u2019s savings to people in need. It is one of the five pillars of Islam.",B.b5I)
B.apV=new A.hM("riba","Interest or usury: an extra amount charged on a loan. Islam forbids it. Scholars discuss its exact limits in detail.",B.c)
B.aqq=new A.hM("qada","Making up a prayer or a fast that was missed.",B.c)
B.apT=new A.hM("tawaf","Walking around the Kaaba seven times as an act of worship, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.c)
B.aPe=s(["sa\u2019i"],t.s)
B.aqu=new A.hM("sa'i","Walking seven times between the hills of Safa and Marwah, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.aPe)
B.aqv=new A.hM("Arafat","The plain near Makkah where pilgrims stand in prayer on the ninth day of Dhul-Hijjah. It is the high point of Hajj.",B.c)
B.aqf=new A.hM("Muzdalifah","A place between Arafat and Mina where pilgrims stop on the night after Arafat during Hajj.",B.c)
B.aqb=new A.hM("Mina","A valley near Makkah where pilgrims stay for some days during Hajj.",B.c)
B.aqg=new A.hM("ihram","The state a pilgrim enters, with the intention for Hajj or Umrah, which begins the pilgrimage.",B.c)
B.aq5=new A.hM("Umrah","The smaller pilgrimage to Makkah, which can be made at any time of the year.",B.c)
B.aq8=new A.hM("barakah","Blessing: goodness and increase that Allah places in something, beyond what can be counted.",B.c)
B.aq6=new A.hM("halal","Permitted in Islam.",B.c)
B.aqo=new A.hM("haram","Forbidden in Islam.",B.c)
B.aqa=new A.hM("niyyah","Intention: the decision in the heart to do an act for the sake of Allah.",B.c)
B.aqd=new A.hM("sadaqah","Voluntary charity: any giving or kindness offered for the sake of Allah, beyond the required zakat.",B.c)
B.aql=new A.hM("wudu","The washing a Muslim does before prayer.",B.c)
B.aqi=new A.hM("salah","Prayer, above all the five daily prayers, the second pillar of Islam.",B.c)
B.apR=new A.hM("dhikr","Remembrance of Allah, for example by repeating His praise.",B.c)
B.aq2=new A.hM("sunnah","The way of the Prophet \ufdfa: what he said, did and approved.",B.c)
