B.Of=s(["Roll the die. You need a six to bring a pawn out of its yard.","A six gives you another roll. There is no penalty for three sixes.","Move one pawn the number rolled. If any pawn can move, you must move.","Land on a lone opponent pawn to send it back to its yard. Capturing does not give an extra roll.","Safe squares (the four start squares and the gold stars) cannot be captured on. Two of your pawns on one square also protect each other.","To reach home a pawn needs the exact number. A bigger roll cannot move it.","First to bring all four pawns home wins. Two to four players; computer players fill empty seats. No stakes of any kind."],t.s)
